    "description": "Ceylon Tobacco Company PLC appoints Sarmad Abbasi to the helm",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Ceylon-Tobacco-Company-PLC-appoints-Sarmad-Abbasi-to-the-helm/34-791252",
