    "chunk_text": "Over the years, the Abans Group has expanded its footprint across multiple sectors, including household electronics, retail, real estate development, environmental management, IT services, automobiles, and logistics. At the heart of this growth are the enduring values instilled by its founder: Honesty, Hard work, and Perseverance. Today, the Group stands strong with over 10,000 employees, united by a culture of trust, loyalty, and shared purpose.\n\nThis new identity reflects the belief that a better way of life is built collectively across homes, businesses, communities, and generations. It underlines the Group\u2019s commitment to creating meaningful impact across every sector it serves.\n\nThe occasion also marked the launch of the Abans Group Manifesto, which was ceremonially presented to the heads of its subsidiary companies. With a continued emphasis on sustainability and environmental responsibility, this manifesto will continue to affirm the Group\u2019s dedication to its core purpose: enabling a Better Way to Life."
