    "chunk_text": "The massive 116-inch display of the RGB Mini-LED TV is designed to transform your living room into a personal theatre, to make you feel the roar of a stadium during a live match, or get lost in the epic sweep of a film, or dive headfirst into immersive gaming. The experience is intelligently powered by the Hi-View AI Engine X, which optimizes picture and sound in real time for any content.\n\n\u201cOur mission at Singhagiri has always been to introduce Sri Lankans to the future of technology, not just follow trends,\u201d says Mr. Majeed, Director at Singhagiri (Pvt) Limited. \u201cLaunching the country\u2019s first RGB Mini LED TV is a milestone of which we are incredibly proud. It reflects our dedication to providing access to category-defining products that offer real, perceptible benefits to our customers.\u201d He added.\n\nDirector Majeed also mentioned that architects will soon begin designing luxury living spaces to accommodate 116\u201d TVs as an upgraded feature of modern home entertainment.\n\nThis launch firmly positions the Hisense RGB Mini LED 116 as the new benchmark for ultra-premium home entertainment in Sri Lanka. It is a statement of leadership from Singhagiri, offering an unmatched combination of technological firsts, immersive scale, and intelligent design.\n\nThis landmark RGB Mini LED extra-large screen Televisions are readily available in 100\u201d size at Singhagiri showrooms islandwide. Pre orders for the 116\u201d screen RGB Mini-LED screens are open now. Contact 0 11 2 133 133 for inquiries."
