    "chunk_text": "Colombo inflation increases to 5.4% in April\n\nThe overall rate of inflation, as measured by the Colombo Consumer Price Index (CCPI) on a year-on-year basis, has increased to 5.4% in April 2026. According to the Department of Census and Statistics, the figure is an increase from the 2.2%\u00a0reported in March this year.\n\nFood inflation has also increased to 2.8% in April compared to the 0.7% recorded in March. Non-food inflation also increased to 6.8% in\u00a0April from 2.9% in March."
  },
