    "chunk_size_bytes": 1672,
    "chunk_text": "Elegant Mother\u2019s Day brunch at Graze Kitchen\n\nHilton Colombo celebrates Mother\u2019s Day with \u2018Graze Her with Love,\u2019 a thoughtfully curated brunch experience at Graze Kitchen, the hotel\u2019s signature all-day dining restaurant. Presenting delicious cuisine, live jazz atmosphere, and a celebratory atmosphere, this exclusive Mother\u2019s Day brunch will allow guests to treat their mothers to an indulgent occasion filled with refined, meaningful moments.\n\nTaking place on 10 May 2026 from 12 noon to 3.00 PM, the Mother\u2019s Day brunch at Graze Kitchen will allow guests to delight in a lavish buffet with signature highlights including Chardonnay infused salmon and lobster thermidor, an oceanic crustacean bar, a Vietnamese b\u00e1nh m\u00ec live station, Hyderabadi lamb biriyani, and seafood teppanyaki. Each dish is designed to offer a diverse and delectable culinary journey perfect for a celebratory Mother\u2019s Day get-together with family.\n\nThe Mother\u2019s Day brunch will also feature Graze Kitchen\u2019s assortment of international cuisines, ranging from Western Grill to Asian Kitchen, complemented by delightful native favorites and a tempting dessert selection.\n\nFurther, in partnership with Sothys Sri Lanka, a renowned premium beauty brand, guests could also participate in an exciting raffle draw where ten lucky mothers could stand a chance to win exclusive gifts and all mothers will receive a voucher courtesy of Sothys Sri Lanka, to be redeemed at their flagship store.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
