    "description": "When AI breaks the news: Trust cannot be automated",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/When-AI-breaks-the-news-Trust-cannot-be-automated/4-791364",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
