    "description": "CCPI spikes in April, exceeds CBSL primary target",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/CCPI-spikes-in-April-exceeds-CBSL-primary-target/34-791393",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
