    "description": "Should digital sense be priority in Sri Lanka\u2019s digital transformation journey?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Should-digital-sense-be-priority-in-Sri-Lanka-s-digital-transformation-journey/4-791494",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
